[6.022193, "o", "# Analytics Sync API\r\n\r\nBase URL is provided by `API_BASE`.\r\n\r\n## POST /webhook\r\n\r\nSyncs one record to analytics.\r\n\r\nJSON body:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"record_id\": 42\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nDocumented limit: 10 requests per second.\r\n\r\n## POST /bulk_sync\r\n"]
[6.022387, "o", "\r\nSyncs many records in one request.\r\n\r\nJSON body:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"record_ids\": [1, 2, 3]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nMaximum batch size: 100.\r\n\r\nDocumented limit: 5 requests per second.\r\n"]
[6.022834, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@308611cb6dda:/app# "]
[6.081422, "i", "find /app -maxdepth 3 -type f | sed 's#^/app/##' | sort | head -200\n"]
